{
    "_metadata": {
        "version": "1.1",
        "description": "Classification rules for Purview custom connectors. Data stewards maintain this file.",
        "last_updated": "2026-04-15",
        "updated_by": "Data Governance Team",
        "notes": [
            "Patterns marked enabled:false require the corresponding custom classification type to be created in Purview before enabling.",
            "Broad wildcard patterns (e.g. *descriptor*, *street*) are intentionally low-priority to minimise false positives.",
            "Credential/secret field patterns are disabled by default — if these fields appear in a scanned source they should be excluded from cataloguing, not classified."
        ]
    },
